                    "description": "Unwind with gentle first-person journeys into nature—where children imagine floating on clouds, growing like a tree, or flowing like a stream. Each track offers a peaceful, calming moment to help young minds relax, reset, and drift off to sleep.\n\nThis free digital card was made by an Independent Creator and published on Yoto Space. Visit Open Mic on Yoto Space to discover more great free titles!  \n\nCreator: Down To Earth Audio   \nFrom the Creator: “Close your eyes and imagine... a world where dreams begin with nature’s whisper and your breath becomes a breeze. This calming audio card guides kids through eight gentle, first-person visualisations—each one a peaceful journey into the heart of the natural world. From floating on clouds to becoming a tree rooted in soft soil, \"Imagine\" helps young listeners wind down with soothing narration, ambient sounds, and a sense of quiet wonder.   \n\nPerfect for bedtime or quiet time, this free card offers a mindful moment before sleep—no screens, just stillness.”  \n\nFor ages: 3-12  \nFeatured on Discover until 1st October \nStays in your library and available on Yoto Space at any time",
